    "text": "Create two vectors of pre- and post-measurements from a medical experiment on blood pressure\n\n\n# create two vectors of pre-measurements and post-measurements using c() function\n\npre_bp1 &lt;- c(130, 128, 116, 124, 133, 134, 118, 126, 114, 127, 141, 138, 128, 140, 137, 131, 120, 128, 139, 135)\n\npost_bp1 &lt;- c(114, 98, 113, 99, 107, 116, 113, 111, 119, 117, 101, 119, 130, 122, 106, 106, 124, 102, 117, 113)\n\n\nAssign names to the vector elements using paste() function\n\n\n# give a name to each vector element using paste() function\n\nnames(pre_bp1) &lt;- paste(\"Subject\", 1:20, sep = \"_\")\n\nnames(post_bp1) &lt;- paste(\"Subject\", 1:20, sep = \"_\")\n\npre_bp1\n\n Subject_1  Subject_2  Subject_3  Subject_4  Subject_5  Subject_6  Subject_7 \n       130        128        116        124        133        134        118 \n Subject_8  Subject_9 Subject_10 Subject_11 Subject_12 Subject_13 Subject_14 \n       126        114        127        141        138        128        140 \nSubject_15 Subject_16 Subject_17 Subject_18 Subject_19 Subject_20 \n       137        131        120        128        139        135 \n\npost_bp1\n\n Subject_1  Subject_2  Subject_3  Subject_4  Subject_5  Subject_6  Subject_7 \n       114         98        113         99        107        116        113 \n Subject_8  Subject_9 Subject_10 Subject_11 Subject_12 Subject_13 Subject_14 \n       111        119        117        101        119        130        122 \nSubject_15 Subject_16 Subject_17 Subject_18 Subject_19 Subject_20 \n       106        106        124        102        117        113 \n\n\n\nCalculate the change in blood pressure for each patient\n\n\n# calculate change by subtracting post-measurements from pre-measurements\n# a positive value is a decrease in blood pressure \n# save calculation as a new object\n\ndiff_bp1 &lt;- pre_bp1 - post_bp1\ndiff_bp1\n\n Subject_1  Subject_2  Subject_3  Subject_4  Subject_5  Subject_6  Subject_7 \n        16         30    